# Direct, top-level dependencies. `requirements.txt` mirrors this file and
# is installed by `docker/Dockerfile.service`; `requirements.lock` pins
# transitive dependencies with hashes. Regenerate it with:
#   .venv-upgrade/bin/pip-compile --generate-hashes --output-file=requirements.lock requirements.in
# Do not hand-edit requirements.lock.
